  - internal/smbclient/*, internal/dpapi/*, internal/lsa/*,
    internal/sam/*, internal/ntds/*, internal/dcsync/*, internal/roast/*,
    internal/getst/*, internal/ticket/* — protocol flows mirrored from
    gopacket tools/ (Apache-2.0), used via the gopacket Go module.

